#: admin.py:168
msgid ""
"A key is stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new key to "
"replace it. The stored value cannot be viewed."
msgstr ""
"Un clave es immagazinate cryptate. Lassa vacue pro lo retener, o entra un "
"nove clave pro reimplaciar lo. Le valor immagazinate non pote esser vidite."

#: admin.py:173
msgid ""
"Entered once, stored encrypted, and cannot be viewed again. Leave empty to "
"use OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."
msgstr ""
"Entrate un vice, immagazinate cryptate, e non pote esser vidite de novo. "
"Lassa vacue pro usar OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."

